# The CUDA-13 ONNX Runtime provider, as a case of its own, 2026-11-27.
#
# Kept apart from resolve-onnx-provider.log on purpose: that one is the clean
# CUDA-12 pairing (ONNX Runtime 1.20.1, provider imports cuBLAS 12, Resolve
# 21.2's own stack) and must not be mixed with this. Nothing here changes the
# CUDA-12 result.
#
# History, from git: before 4248953 (2026-11-25, "Move to ONNX Runtime 1.32.0")
# the template's examples and the suite used 1.20.1; 4248953 moved them to
# 1.32.0 for size and currency, and 4488806 added the host CUDA-major gate whose
# build.bat default is 12, because the host this bundle is built for is Resolve
# 21.2 with CUDA 12.
#
# The question here is only the dependency question: which *_13 DLLs does the
# 1.32.0 provider require, and what does that mean for a host on CUDA 12?
#
# The provider is built with OFXPLUGIN_CUDA_FROM_HOST=ON and
# OFXPLUGIN_HOST_CUDA_MAJOR=13 (the override, because the default 12 refuses it
# at build time - see the gate at the end).

